## 3. Data contract (OData V2, service `ZCSR_CHECKLIST_SRV`)

Entity sets (keys in parentheses):
- `ChecklistHeaderSet` (HeaderGuid) — read-only CRUD; status NEVER changes via property update
- `ChecklistItemSet` (HeaderGuid, QuestionId) — MERGE-updatable: `Response`, `NaFlag` only
- `AttachmentSet` (AttachGuid) — **media entity**: create via POST stream + `slug`, read via `$value`, delete = soft delete
- `ReviewSet`, `AiFlagSet` (read-only), `QuestionSet` (read-only)
- Value helps: `MarketSegVHSet` (has `Lob` for cascading), `LobVHSet`, `AnalystVHSet`

Navigation from `ChecklistHeader`: `ToItems`, `ToAttachments`, `ToReviews`, `ToAiFlags`.
`ChecklistItem` → `ToAttachments` (per-question evidence).

`ChecklistItem` carries denormalized catalog fields (read-only): `Section`, `Seqnr`,
`Title`, `QuestionText`, `ExampleText`, `Inptype` (`I`|`C`), `RespRequired`,
`AttachMode` (`N`|`O`|`R`), `NaAllowed`.

Function imports (all POST unless noted) — **the only way state changes**:
- `SubmitChecklist(HeaderGuid)` — validates server-side; success stamps signature+timestamp
- `StartReview(HeaderGuid)`, `CompleteReview(HeaderGuid, Outcome, Notes)`
- `ReassignChecklist(HeaderGuid, NewAnalyst)`
- `GenerateInstances(Chktype, PeriodYear, PeriodQtr)`
- `TriggerAiTriage(HeaderGuid)`
- `ExportEvidence(HeaderGuid)` — GET, returns binary ZIP; trigger a browser download

Status domain: `NS` Not Started → `IP` In Progress → `SB` Submitted → `UR` Under Review →
`CP` Completed (locked) or `RT` Returned (→ back to IP). The UI never writes `Status`.

## 4. Routing (manifest)

| Route | Pattern | View | Access |
|---|---|---|---|
| `worklist` | `` (empty) | Worklist | AN/AD |
| `detail` | `checklist/{headerGuid}` | ChecklistDetail, mode=edit | owner/backup/AD |
| `review` | `review` | ReviewQueue | RV/AD |
| `detailReview` | `review/{headerGuid}` | ChecklistDetail, mode=review | RV/AD |
| `admin` | `admin` | AdminBoard | AD |
| `notFound` | `:all*:` | NotFound | — |

One ChecklistDetail view serves both modes; `{app>/mode}` drives editability via expression
binding. Deep links from reminder e-mails hit `#/checklist/{guid}` directly — guard in
`onPatternMatched`, route 403s to NotFound. UI role gating is convenience only; the ABAP
backend AUTHORITY-CHECK is authoritative.

## 5. ChecklistDetail — procedure cards (core screen)

Render one **card per `ChecklistItem` with `Inptype === 'I'`**, ordered by `Seqnr`,
grouped by `Section`. Items with `Inptype === 'C'` render in a collapsed
**Instructions panel** above the first card (auto-expand on first open of a checklist).

Card anatomy, top to bottom:
1. **Title bar** — `"{Seqnr} · {Title}"` + completion indicator (✓ answered / open / N/A)
2. **Requirement text** — `sap.m.Text` with `maxLines="3"` + a "Show more" toggle
   (`QuestionText` runs 600–1,600 chars; never render fully expanded by default)
3. **Example** — collapsed `sap.m.Panel` rendering `ExampleText` (skip if empty)
4. **Response** — `sap.m.TextArea` (growing), CSS class `zcsrInput` (green).
   An **N/A `sap.m.Switch` renders ONLY when `NaAllowed`**; toggling on disables the
   TextArea, sets `NaFlag=true`, and satisfies the response requirement
5. **Attachments** — render ONLY when `AttachMode !== 'N'`. `sap.m.upload.UploadSet`
   bound to the item's `ToAttachments`, CSS class `zcsrAttach` (yellow). Label
   "Optional Attachments" for `O`, "Required evidence" for `R`

Autosave: on `liveChange` debounce 2 s, then `oModel.submitChanges()` (MERGE batch).
Flush on route-leave. Show "Draft autosaved hh:mm:ss" in the footer. Set
`refreshAfterChange=false`; refresh bindings explicitly after function imports.

Submit button label: **"Sign & Submit"** (i18n key `btnSignSubmit`). On business error,
push the V2 error container details into `sap.ui.core.message.MessageManager`, map each
failing `QuestionId` to its control (`ValueState.Error` + text), and open the message
popover. Success: refresh header, lock the form, `MessageToast`.

Review mode additions: read-only form, AI-flag panel expanded (`ToAiFlags`), footer =
"Complete Review" / "Return to Analyst" (ReturnNotesDialog, notes mandatory client-side
AND server-enforced).

## 6. Validation semantics (client-side mirror; server is authoritative)

A checklist is submittable when, for every item with `Inptype === 'I'`:
- `RespRequired` → `Response` non-empty **or** (`NaAllowed` && `NaFlag`)
- `AttachMode === 'R'` → at least one non-deleted attachment on the item
`AttachMode === 'O'` never blocks. Client checks exist for UX only — never skip the
function import, never simulate its result.

## 7. Formatters, styling, UX conventions

- `formatter.statusState`: NS→None, IP→Warning, SB/UR→Information, RT→Error, CP→Success
- `formatter.severityState`: H→Error, M→Warning, L→Information
- Theme `sap_horizon`; custom CSS limited to `.zcsrInput` (light green bg/border),
  `.zcsrAttach` (light yellow), `.zcsrComment` (neutral gray). Do not restyle anything else.
- Status must always be conveyed by **text + semantic state**, never color alone.
- Worklist filter bar: cascading LOB → Market Segment ComboBoxes using `MarketSegVHSet`
  filtered by `Lob`; whole-LOB CSR rows display Segment "All".
- Tables: `growing="true"` `growingThreshold="25"`; no client-side loading of full sets.

## 8. ABAP reference (when asked for backend snippets)

- Classic ABAP OO. Tables `ZCSR_HEADER`, `ZCSR_ITEM`, `ZCSR_QCATALOG`, `ZCSR_ATTACH`,
  `ZCSR_REVIEW`, `ZCSR_ASSIGN`, `ZCSR_AIFLAG`, `ZCSR_DEADLINE`.
- Attachment bytes: XSTRING written **directly** to `ZCSR_ATTACH-CONTENT`
  (never `EXPORT ... TO DATA BUFFER`); SHA-256 via `CL_ABAP_MESSAGE_DIGEST`;
  storage access only through interface `ZIF_CSR_ATTACH_STORE` (impl `ZCL_CSR_ATTACH_DB`).
- Media handling in `CREATE_STREAM` / `GET_STREAM` of the DPC_EXT; `Content-Disposition`
  with the original filename on download; byte-identical round trip is a hard requirement.
- Business errors: raise `/IWBEP/CX_MPC_BUSI_EXCEPTION` with a message container so
  `SubmitChecklist` returns ALL validation failures in one response.
- Locking via lock object `EZCSR_HEADER`; every state change writes change documents
  (SCDO object `ZCSR`); status transitions validated against the matrix in `ZCL_CSR_MODEL`.
- AI calls: `ZCL_CSR_AI_CLIENT`, SM59 destination `ZCSR_LLM`, POST `/v1/chat/completions`,
  JSON-only response parsed with `/UI2/CL_JSON`. AI failure = zero flags, **never** blocks
  submission. AI output is advisory; nothing auto-approves.

## 9. Local development & testing

- `ui5 serve` with `localService/mockserver.js` (`sap.ui.core.util.MockServer`) against
  `metadata.xml`; mock data mirrors the seeded catalog (4 CSR-LOB procedures,
  3 Quarter-Close-LOB procedures, instruction rows) and the LOB/segment value tables
  (MIC2, SEMS, SAC, TLS; 13 segments + 'ALL').
- Mock the function imports explicitly (MockServer does not auto-mock them): attach
  handlers that mutate mock data status fields per the transition matrix.
- QUnit for `formatter.js` and validation mirror; OPA5 journeys for: analyst happy path
  (fill → Sign & Submit), blocked submit (itemized errors), N/A flow, reviewer return flow.
- Definition of done for any UI task: works against mockserver, no console errors,
  all strings in i18n, keyboard accessible, and no APIs outside UI5 1.108.

